DESCRIPTION:A CLINICAL RESEARCH STUDY PROGRAM FOR MAJOR DEPRESSIVE DISORDE
 R (MDD)\nIf your current antidepressant medication(s) is/are not adequatel
 y improving symptoms of your MDD\, you may be eligible for the AMPA PROGRA
